      "summary": "Line chart on logarithmic axes, one series: completion-confirmed TBCCL transfers from 4 KiB to 16 MiB. The time is 126 microseconds at 4 KiB, 269 at 64 KiB, 1,118 at 1 MiB (range 779 to 1,480 over repetitions), 2,432 at 4 MiB and 8,669 at 16 MiB. Each time includes the acknowledgement's return trip. Small and medium messages are latency- and variability-bound. Ping-pong round trips are a different kind of measurement and are left in the table.",
